WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.999 --> 00:00:05.770
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and this week
on Arrow we found out when you tell people

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:07.950
the truth, they get struck by lightning.

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.300
Especially if you’re Felicity.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:15.280
Seriously though I was making my list of top
moments and ended up with 10, so there’s

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:17.910
going to be a ton of extra stuff in this video
because we just learned what Slade’s end

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:19.289
game is for this season.

00:00:19.289 --> 00:00:23.160
If anyone caught it too, Stephen Amell tweeted
that Miley Cyrus line.

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:24.940
Slade came in like a wrecking ball.

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:29.010
The way he wrote it, you have to imagine him
singing it in his trailer.

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:33.620
If you’re finding me for the first time
I do Arrow videos every week with Q&amp;As on

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:37.770
thursday, it’s kind of like my DC time during
the week.

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:38.809
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:38.809 --> 00:00:41.980
Since there’s so much awesome to talk about
let’s just plow through top 10 moments.

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:45.690
Then I’ll mention as many comic book references
as possible and do my review.

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:48.460
Careful for spoilers if you haven’t seen
the episode yet.

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:51.190
Here we go, Number 10 - Slade Recruits and
Army

00:00:51.190 --> 00:00:55.560
He’s going to turn all those prisoners into
super soldiers and let Brother Blood use them

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:57.120
to take over the city.

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:59.840
This also tied back into what Diggle said
at the beginning.

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:02.829
There’s too many prisoners since Oliver
stopped killing them.

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:04.850
Thus Slade’s army is born.

00:01:04.850 --> 00:01:08.840
They were all headed to Starling City’s
version of Arkham too, so they’re all grade

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:09.840
A psychos.

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:15.570
Here’s an image of them in full on Deathstroke
gear that someone captured from City of Blood.

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:17.409
They’re all dressed up like Slade.

00:01:17.409 --> 00:01:19.100
Pretty freaking sweet right?

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:23.250
Number 9 - Sara Tries to Suicide Bomb Slade

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:27.460
This was really important foreshadowing for
a future WTF moment I think.

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:29.310
First off, Sara is super dark.

00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:31.729
There was even that line, when did you get
so bad?

00:01:31.729 --> 00:01:34.430
David Nykl from stargate goes all WTF on her.

00:01:34.430 --> 00:01:38.890
It failed, but I think she’s going to use
that idea again in present day.

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:41.540
Only what if she turns herself into a bomb.

00:01:41.540 --> 00:01:42.689
Let me know if you agree.

00:01:42.689 --> 00:01:46.649
Please don’t die Caity Lotz, Suicide Bombing
Deathstroke probably wouldn’t work anyway.

00:01:46.649 --> 00:01:48.009
Mirakuru can heal anything.

00:01:48.009 --> 00:01:49.400
except this!

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:52.490
Number 8 - Oliver’s fight montage en route
to Slade

00:01:52.490 --> 00:01:56.350
Stephen Amell actually posted a behind the
scenes video of this when they were practicing

00:01:56.350 --> 00:01:59.190
it, like the day in a life videos he does
on facebook.

00:01:59.190 --> 00:02:02.340
It was months ago at the time he couldn’t
say anything about it.

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:06.920
First off, Arrow’s stunts are awesome and
this in his own words was one of the biggest

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:10.289
and most well choreographed montages all season
long.

00:02:10.289 --> 00:02:12.620
And I agree.

00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:19.560
It’s also interesting to note the time jump
between production and episodes dropping.

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:24.670
Just this week he did another post saying
they only had about 12 days left of shooting

00:02:24.670 --> 00:02:25.670
in the season.

00:02:25.670 --> 00:02:27.890
And it takes a little over a week to shoot
an episode.

00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:32.170
So really they’re filming the finale right
now.

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:33.570
More on that later.

00:02:33.570 --> 00:02:37.340
Number 7 - Oliver And Slade In the Police
Station

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:39.910
This was their first real moment together
since the island.

00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:44.239
I don’t consider that scene outside his
car during The Promise to be a full moment.

00:02:44.239 --> 00:02:47.260
Just because he was basically bitch slapping
Oliver.

00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:50.680
This time in the police station was their
first real moment.

00:02:50.680 --> 00:02:54.950
They’re not just spitting threats at each
other and flexing their muscles.

00:02:54.950 --> 00:02:59.280
Let me know if you thought this too, but when
Slade was chained up it reminded me of Leoben

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:01.250
on Battlestar Galactica.

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:04.569
When Starbuck was interrogating him and called
him out about being a cylon.

00:03:04.569 --> 00:03:12.420
She didn’t believe him and to prove it he
snapped the metal cuffs and crushed the table.

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:17.550
Slade is using Thea and Laurel and yoinking
the company to create distractions for him

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:25.650
while he builds the army.

00:03:25.650 --> 00:03:28.019
Number 6 - Slade Hallucinates Shado

00:03:28.019 --> 00:03:32.430
When they announced the episode, Marc Guggenheim
said we’d learn what the mirakuru had done

00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:36.339
to his brain and what had been going on in
his head for the last 5 years.

00:03:36.339 --> 00:03:38.599
And we literally got a picture of what’s
going on.

00:03:38.599 --> 00:03:45.019
The Shado we saw isn’t someone with superpowers,
she’s not secretly a meta human.

00:03:45.019 --> 00:03:47.349
It’s just him talking to himself.

00:03:47.349 --> 00:03:51.720
Like his mind created an evil imaginary friend
that’s telling him what to do and say.

00:03:51.720 --> 00:03:54.549
Remember how he was speaking the words Shado
was speaking.

00:03:54.549 --> 00:03:59.800
We’ll call that Shado hallucination Slade
2, and nice normal sane Slade, Slade Prime.

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:04.860
Now after we saw her, don’t you feel like
Slade Prime is still in there somewhere and

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:07.269
before the end of the season, we’ll see
him again.

00:04:07.269 --> 00:04:11.570
In the police station he said he hasn’t
been able to get “the island” out of his

00:04:11.570 --> 00:04:13.290
head in the last 5 years.

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:17.310
So in all the current day scenes, you have
to picture a shado telling him what to say

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:19.790
to Thea, Laurel, and everyone else.

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:29.090
It’s like this revenge plot against Oliver
was conceived and is being carried out by

00:04:29.090 --> 00:04:34.970
Shado and Slade is just another puppet.

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:37.680
Number 5 - Slade Tells Thea About Merlyn

00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:40.590
He did it just to drive a wedge between Oliver
and his family.

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:41.590
He’s trying to isolate him.

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:46.150
I actually expected to see Merlyn appear out
of the shadows when she left the police station.

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:50.889
I think we’re meant to take away that she
and Roy just split town temporarily.

00:04:50.889 --> 00:04:53.270
That doesn’t mean that Merlyn won’t come
back soon.

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:58.210
In the Q&amp;A he posted before the episode Stephen
Amell said the person he’d like to fight

00:04:58.210 --> 00:05:01.630
again would be the Dark Archer, because they
still have unfinished business.

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:06.240
And he also talked in a different post about
seeing lots of ‘old faces’ on the set

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:08.139
while they were filming the finale.

00:05:08.139 --> 00:05:12.010
Obviously after this episode I think we have
to assume he was talking about Shado being

00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:16.580
back again for more Slade hallucination scenes
and I also think he was saying that John Barrowman

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.090
was back on set.

00:05:18.090 --> 00:05:19.300
Unconfirmed though.

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:22.539
Number 4 - Slade Reveals Oliver’s Identity
To Laurel

00:05:22.539 --> 00:05:25.300
Just another distraction as he put it, but
I liked Laurel’s reaction.

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:29.760
You saw her eyes darting around as if she
was suddenly putting a lot of pieces together.

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:34.830
I think she’ll end up being an asset to
Team Arrow in a twist to what Thea’s reaction

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:36.030
was.

00:05:36.030 --> 00:05:40.360
Laurel already spent most of the season self-destructing,
so I think she’s going to become the next

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:43.460
honorary member of team arrow before the end
of the season.

00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:49.759
There was this really ominous thing the producers
said at Comic Con 2012.

00:05:49.759 --> 00:05:54.960
Laurel will become the black canary, later
than you hope, but sooner than you expect.

00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:57.120
Which is not good news for Sara.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:06:02.460
Also refer back to my number 9 top moment
about Sara potentially suicide bombing Slade.

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:05.990
Number 3 - Roy Quits Team Arrow

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:10.770
I flipped just a little when Roy lost his
shit all over Diggle and Sara pulled the arrow

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:11.770
on him.

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:15.419
I felt like he would explode at some point
this season and I think this was it.

00:06:15.419 --> 00:06:19.270
He didn’t join Team Deathstroke, but he
did skip town with Thea.

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:23.819
I fully expect him to be back in time to help
Oliver defeat Slade.

00:06:23.819 --> 00:06:26.630
But he wasn’t in the trailer for the next
episode.

00:06:26.630 --> 00:06:31.870
Oliver’s friends and family are deserting
him one by one, which is Slade’s plan.

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:34.130
And it’s only going to get worse.

00:06:34.130 --> 00:06:38.450
Episode 19 will feature Killer frost, one
of the villains from The Flash tv show and

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:39.450
Vibe.

00:06:39.450 --> 00:06:44.639
Vibe was a good character in the comics, so
hopefully he’ll help Team Arrow somehow.

00:06:44.639 --> 00:06:50.650
Number 2 - Oliver Versus Isabel or Rose Wilson
Whatever you want to call her.

00:06:50.650 --> 00:06:53.449
Let’s just all say what we’re thinking
here.

00:06:53.449 --> 00:06:54.449
Ravager.

00:06:54.449 --> 00:06:57.979
Even if they’re sticking with the Isabel
Rochev name, she has the fighting skills of

00:06:57.979 --> 00:07:01.840
Ravager and dropped all these references about
sins of the father.

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:06.130
She was mostly referring to Oliver’s father,
because her name Isabel was on his list.

00:07:06.130 --> 00:07:07.820
The list from season 1.

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:12.480
But I also think it could have been a subtle
reference to Slade being Ravager’s father.

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:17.750
If she puts battle gear on that looks remotely
like Slade’s I’m going to lose my shit.

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:21.890
She has a history with Slade that predates
Starling City and she knows all about the

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:22.890
Island.

00:07:22.890 --> 00:07:27.500
I don’t remember, but did Slade know all
about that list Oliver’s father gave to

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:28.500
him.

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:32.680
If Isabel isn’t his daughter, he’d only
have known her connection with the Queens

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:35.069
if he’d seen her name on the list.

00:07:35.069 --> 00:07:37.470
Which is just more evidence that she really
is Rose Wilson.

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:42.720
In the Russia episode she talked about growing
up without real father, so it’s possible

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:45.890
that Isabel Rochev is just her adopted name.

00:07:45.890 --> 00:07:46.890
Let me know if you agree.

00:07:46.890 --> 00:07:52.139
and my number one moment - The evil Trinity
becomes Team Deathstroke

00:07:52.139 --> 00:07:57.660
It’s like Slade is evil superman, Isabel
is evil Wonder Woman and Brother Blood is

00:07:57.660 --> 00:07:59.210
evil Batman.

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:00.979
Evil Trinity for the win.

00:08:00.979 --> 00:08:04.870
I’m just going to refer to them as Team
Deathstroke from here on out.

00:08:04.870 --> 00:08:09.710
I love how Brother Blood is basically on a
need to know basis with Slade and Isabel seems

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:10.759
to know everything.

00:08:10.759 --> 00:08:14.700
That makes me wonder if Slade with double
cross Brother Blood at some point.

00:08:14.700 --> 00:08:19.270
Or use him as a metaphorical human shield.

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:24.410
There are still a few huge questions I have,
namely when did Slade start working with Isabel?

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:29.349
And after Slade uses his super soldier army
to take Starling City, what is he going to

00:08:29.349 --> 00:08:30.349
do with it?

00:08:30.349 --> 00:08:32.959
and what is he going to do with all the soldiers?

00:08:32.959 --> 00:08:36.620
The super soldiers just seem like a means
to an end, as does taking the city.

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:39.360
I don’t think he cares about ruling a city.

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:43.690
So is he planning on just destroying everything
after he’s done breaking Oliver?

00:08:43.690 --> 00:08:49.790
Like in the comics when Hal Jordan as Parallax
destroyed Coastal City, literally wiped it

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:51.850
from the face of the planet.

00:08:51.850 --> 00:08:53.320
Let me know what you think.

00:08:53.320 --> 00:08:58.440
What is Slade going to do with the City and
the soldiers after he’s done and what was

00:08:58.440 --> 00:08:59.440
your favorite moment?

00:08:59.440 --> 00:09:03.930
Overall the episode was a solid A plus.

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:10.570
There were so many big moments I had to change
my video to make room.

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:14.500
The rest of the season is just going to be
them jamming on the accelerator towards the

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:18.020
final confrontation and hopefully an appearance
by Ra’s Al Ghul.

00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:22.089
I love what Manu Bennett and the writers have
done for Slade’s character this season.

00:09:22.089 --> 00:09:24.860
He derserves his own spinoff show.

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:28.649
It would be like Dexter with more action.

00:09:28.649 --> 00:09:30.660
Told from the perspective of Slade as the
protagonist.

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:37.910
To add to all that, there’s the new added
dimension of his crazy mind - shado telling

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:39.720
him what to do, like an evil tinkerbell.

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:42.620
I can’t wait to see it all play out.

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:44.649
That last end teaser, Oliver’s comment.

00:09:44.649 --> 00:09:47.529
We go to war. is all about them going on the
offensive.

00:09:47.529 --> 00:09:52.410
I have no idea how those Flash characters
figure into that, but we’ll find out next

00:09:52.410 --> 00:09:53.410
week.

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:58.220
Here’s a couple of comic book references
I picked up that were pretty awesome.

00:09:58.220 --> 00:10:01.460
First off was Felicity’s line about telling
someone the truth and them getting struck

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:02.470
by lightning.

00:10:02.470 --> 00:10:07.170
Just a nice joke about Barry Allen.

00:10:07.170 --> 00:10:10.950
There was another giant Thea Speedy namedrop.

00:10:10.950 --> 00:10:14.830
There was a reference to Brother Eye when
Oliver mentioned people in their orbit getting

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:15.830
hurt.

00:10:15.830 --> 00:10:20.450
Brother Eye was Batman’s crazy satellite
that stores the weaknesses of all super humans

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:22.770
on the planet.

00:10:22.770 --> 00:10:25.279
It also could have been a reference to the
Watchtower.

00:10:25.279 --> 00:10:28.950
So many WTF moments though, one of the best
episodes yet.

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:35.190
Next week Arrow is on break, so I’ll be
doing a bonus video.

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:36.550
Be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:10:36.550 --> 00:10:38.020
I’m posting my regular Q&amp;A video tomorrow.

00:10:38.020 --> 00:10:40.350
So be sure to write any big questions in the
comments.

00:10:40.350 --> 00:10:42.860
Right now click here to get that video.

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:47.140
I’ll add the annotation as soon as I post
it, and click here for last week’s birds

00:10:47.140 --> 00:10:48.140
of prey video.

00:10:48.140 --> 00:10:49.160
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:49.480
High Fives!

